="T20">I love what I do at the end of the day. </ts><ts n="e" id="Seg_3020" s="T20" e="T21">I know that I'm putting myself up for criticism </ts><ts n="e" id="Seg_3022" s="T21" e="T22">and I'm very much aware of that, </ts><ts n="e" id="Seg_3024" s="T22" e="T23">but I love what I do. </ts></ts><ts n="sc" id="Seg_3025" s="T36" e="T38"><ts n="e" id="Seg_3027" s="T36" e="T37">((0,3s)) Yeah. </ts><ts n="e" id="Seg_3029" s="T37" e="T38">((laughing))</ts></ts><ts n="sc" id="Seg_3030" s="T40" e="T41"><ts n="e" id="Seg_3032" s="T40" e="T41">((laughing)) </ts></ts><ts n="sc" id="Seg_3033" s="T42" e="T43"><ts n="e" id="Seg_3035" s="T42" e="T43">((laughing)) </ts></ts><ts n="sc" id="Seg_3036" s="T51" e="T53"><ts n="e" id="Seg_3038" s="T51" e="T52">Yeah. </ts><ts n="e" id="Seg_3040" s="T52" e="T53">((1,2s)) </ts></ts><ts n="sc" id="Seg_3041" s="T54" e="T63"><ts n="e" id="Seg_3043" s="T54" e="T55">((laughing)) </ts><ts n="e" id="Seg_3045" s="T55" e="T56">No, I mean, I knew as soon as I met him. </ts><ts n="e" id="Seg_3047" s="T56" e="T57">I mean, ((0,4s)) </ts><ts n="e" id="Seg_3049" s="T57" e="T58">the/ one of the most attractive things I found with David is that </ts><ts n="e" id="Seg_3051" s="T58" e="T59">((0,3s)) he shared the same sort of family values as me. </ts><ts n="e" id="Seg_3053" s="T59" e="T60">((0,3s))You know he was sitting there with his family and/ and I really liked that. </ts><ts n="e" id="Seg_3055" s="T60" e="T61">And he is a very kind </ts><ts n="e" id="Seg_3057" s="T61" e="T62">((0,5s)) person. </ts><ts n="e" id="Seg_3059" s="T62" e="T63">And we/ we are really good friends, on top of everything. </ts></ts><ts n="sc" id="Seg_3060" s="T71" e="T86"><ts n="e" id="Seg_3062" s="T71" e="T72">That was probably one of the most difficult things to actually write </ts><ts n="e" id="Seg_3064" s="T72" e="T73">in the book. </ts><ts n="e" id="Seg_3066" s="T73" e="T74">Obviously, it's lovely writing all the nice things that've happened </ts><ts n="e" id="Seg_3068" s="T74" e="T75">but that was very difficult. </ts><ts n="e" id="Seg_3070" s="T75" e="T76">I mean it was really a traumatic time for/ </ts><ts n="e" id="Seg_3072" s="T76" e="T77">((0,4s)) for both of us. </ts><ts n="e" id="Seg_3074" s="T77" e="T78">((0,3s)) Ehm, ((0,3s)) you know, I was pregnant at the time. </ts><ts n="e" id="Seg_3076" s="T78" e="T79">And I think that a few girls wanted to launch a modelling career, so decided to drag </ts><ts n="e" id="Seg_3078" s="T79" e="T80">((0,5s)) David's name into that. </ts><ts n="e" id="Seg_3080" s="T80" e="T81">And, ((0,4s))</ts><ts n="e" id="Seg_3082" s="T81" e="T82">you know I think that you took it too cool, didn't you? </ts><ts n="e" id="Seg_3084" s="T82" e="T84">Eh </ts><ts n="e" id="Seg_3086" s="T84" e="T85">a couple of the cases, </ts><ts n="e" id="Seg_3088" s="T85" e="T86">but it was really… </ts></ts><ts n="sc" id="Seg_3089" s="T89" e="T101"><ts n="e" id="Seg_3091" s="T89" e="T90">It did for a while. </ts><ts n="e" id="Seg_3093" s="T90" e="T91">I mean as much as you can trust someone and someone can say "Honestly, I haven't done this. I don't know this person", </ts><ts n="e" id="Seg_3095" s="T91" e="T92">as much as you want to believe that person </ts><ts n="e" id="Seg_3097" s="T92" e="T93">((0,3s)) they've still put that element to doubt in your mind. </ts><ts n="e" id="Seg_3099" s="T93" e="T94">You know, people can say what they want about me. </ts><ts n="e" id="Seg_3101" s="T94" e="T95">((0,4s)) Ehm, but David is the one person and Brooklyn ((0,5s)) </ts><ts n="e" id="Seg_3103" s="T95" e="T96">that ((0,3s)) is mine. </ts><ts n="e" id="Seg_3105" s="T96" e="T97">You know, ((0,3s)) people can't touch </ts><ts n="e" id="Seg_3107" s="T97" e="T98">and won't touch. </ts><ts n="e" id="Seg_3109" s="T98" e="T99">((laughing))</ts><ts n="e" id="Seg_3111" s="T99" e="T100">And so when somebody tries to/ ((0,5s)) </ts><ts n="e" id="Seg_3113" s="T100" e="T101">to cause problems in that area I mean that's ((0,7s)) how it gets me. </ts></ts><ts n="sc" id="Seg_3114" s="T102" e="T105"><ts n="e" id="Seg_3116" s="T102" e="T103">((0,9s)) (T/ m/ ) right,</ts><ts n="e" id="Seg_3118" s="T103" e="T104">I have whacked him. </ts><ts n="e" id="Seg_3120" s="T104" e="T105">((laughing)) </ts></ts><ts n="sc" id="Seg_3121" s="T106" e="T107"><ts n="e" id="Seg_3123" s="T106" e="T107">((laughing)) </ts></ts><ts n="sc" id="Seg_3124" s="T140" e="T145"><ts n="e" id="Seg_3126" s="T140" e="T141">I actually, I took that out </ts><ts n="e" id="Seg_3128" s="T141" e="T142">of the book but,… </ts><ts n="e" id="Seg_3130" s="T142" e="T143">((laughing)) </ts><ts n="e" id="Seg_3132" s="T143" e="T144">That eh yeah. </ts><ts n="e" id="Seg_3134" s="T144" e="T145">((laughing))</ts></ts><ts n="sc" id="Seg_3135" s="T147" e="T149"><ts n="e" id="Seg_3137" s="T147" e="T148">I didn't put it in there. </ts><ts n="e" id="Seg_3139" s="T148" e="T149">((laughing)) </ts></ts><ts n="sc" id="Seg_3140" s="T152" e="T154"><ts n="e" id="Seg_3142" s="T152" e="T154">((laughing))</ts></ts></segmentation></segmented-tier><segmented-tier id="TIE2" speaker="SPK2" category="v" type="t" display-name="DAV [v]"><timeline-fork start="T33" end="T34"><tli id="T33.TIE2.1"/>
